# ===========================================================================
# Model weights & artifacts -- regenerate locally, NEVER commit (multi-GB).
#   gpt2-hf/            HuggingFace GPT-2 124M (upstream download)
#   gpt2-nanovllm/      nano-vllm-format weights (convert_gpt2.py)
#   gpt2-sft-nanovllm/  SFT weights (convert_nanogpt.py)
#   nanoGPT/out-sft/    nanoGPT SFT checkpoint (ckpt.pt ~1.4GB)
# ===========================================================================
gpt2-hf/
gpt2-nanovllm/
gpt2-sft-nanovllm/
nanoGPT/out-sft/

# large binary blobs anywhere in the tree
*.bin
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.tflite
*.msgpack
*.h5
*.onnx
*.ot
*.ckpt
flax_model.msgpack

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored nanoGPT (github.com/karpathy/nanoGPT, MIT). We only track the SFT
# data-prep script we wrote; everything else is upstream / generated.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nanoGPT/*
!nanoGPT/data/
nanoGPT/data/*
!nanoGPT/data/sft/
nanoGPT/data/sft/*
!nanoGPT/data/sft/prepare.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# nano-vllm ships an optional Rust sampler crate; its build output is huge and
# is already version-controlled upstream. Ignore the whole crate here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nano-vllm/rust/

# misc
*.orig
*.bak
*.rej
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rust workspace build output (nano-vllm-rs). Large; regenerated by cargo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nano-vllm-rs/target/
nano-vllm-rs/**/Cargo.lock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# snake-gpt2 demo artifacts (nano-vllm-rs). Fully regenerable:
#   scripts/train_gpt2_snake.py  -> out-gpt2-snake/ckpt.pt
#   scripts/export_safetensors.py -> model.safetensors + config.json + meta.json
#   scripts/compare_logits.py    -> parity.json + ref_*.npy
# Weight files are already caught by *.pt / *.safetensors above; this ignores
# the whole dir plus the downloaded corpus & python bytecode.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
out-gpt2-snake/
out-agent-snake-export/
nano-vllm-rs/scripts/out-agent-html-export/
nano-vllm-rs/scripts/data-shakespeare-char/input.txt
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
link_repos
